<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">reinforced-disarm-kit</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

A specialized kit for disarming traps, with reinforced metalwork that
improves reliability when working with intricate trigger mechanisms.
Heavier construction provides better leverage and stability during
delicate operations.

